name issue_5_burst15_freeze
describe 2% loss in 15-packet bursts: libwebrtc's frame dropper keeps video freezes short (issue #5, partial)
duration 30s
seed 7
# Target (issue #5): video.longest_freeze_ms < 1000 and video.freeze_count <= 2, with
# libwebrtc's values on this scenario from the CI compare-webrtc job as the final bar.
# The expectations below lock in the level reached by the FrameDropper port (seeds 1-10:
# longest freeze <= 528 ms, at most 6 freezes); main had 647 ms on this seed.
at 0s capacity=2000kbps delay=50ms jitter=3ms loss=2% burst=15 queue=300ms
expect video.longest_freeze_ms < 600
expect video.freeze_count <= 6
